      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@Razgriz explained that the bug is portal prompt is connected to the HUD setting instead of the Show Tooltips setting like other interacts.\n\nFurthermore, all interacts show a blue outline regardless of Show Tooltips or HUD options, so that needs to be addressed too.\n\nI think there's a bug here since I play with HUD off and Show Tooltips on, and portal prompt shows no visual indicator that I need to do something to get in. I thought portals were broken for weeks.\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/490268376107581450/1099144182913831073/2023-04-21_18-25-26.mp4\n\nAttached: screenshots of how *other* interacts appear with Show Tooltips on and off. Even with HUD turned off, there is a visual indicator.",
